VALUES ('ver_338613da12d5a29e3e4947118c87f7ea', 'page_zm_beta_oct10', 1, 'Zombie Match 3D beta - Oct 10', '<p>Beta on Oct 10. Go/no-go on Thursday Oct 2.</p><p>Sign-off: client side (Oliver) and server side (Douglas), rules on the ZM ROADMAP board, BETA: Oct 10 list.</p><p>Sign-off folder: ZM Beta sign-off (Drive, Arthur''s). Client QA keeps its own folder.</p><p>Store builds: Android 0.3.122 / iOS 0.3.38 are the beta candidates.</p>', 'user_EMPLOYEE_0025', NULL, '2025-09-29T17:15:00Z');
