VALUES ('douglas@harmonygames.co/<CAuC1dALZU8ymJT3qa3a7Oqa5TvKZhNe0pW0P7QP@mail.gmail.com>', 'douglas@harmonygames.co/1844721277206562572', 'douglas@harmonygames.co', '["INBOX", "IMPORTANT", "CATEGORY_PERSONAL"]', 'Douglas, Two things for the register before Leonard gets it. First, leave ZOM-547 and ZOM-553 off. The boss arena balance and refill/nuke va', 1759264887000, '2025-09-30T20:41:27Z', 1852, 'Re: beta go/no-go thursday', 'arthur.blake@harmonygames.co', 'Arthur Blake', '["Douglas <douglas@harmonygames.co>"]', '["Leonard Hayes <leonard.hayes@harmonygames.co>"]', '[]', '[]', E'Douglas,\n\nTwo things for the register before Leonard gets it. First, leave ZOM-547 and ZOM-553 off. The boss arena balance and refill/nuke values players get come from the client''s balance sheet; the backend copies (match3d-backend#49 and #53) are only mirrors. They''re not part of the count either way.\n\nSecond, two of the imports in your deploy log are server changes for tickets whose comments don''t say so: the analytics events table import is part of the server change for ZOM-444 and ZOM-436, and the loadout table import is part of ZOM-531''s. Both are still only on dev.\n\nRest of the card stands.\n\nArthur\n\nOn Tue, Sep 30, 2025 at 1:15 PM Leonard Hayes <leonard.hayes@harmonygames.co> wrote:\n> Hi Douglas,\n>\n> For Thursday''s go/no-go: once your server register is in the beta folder, please share it with me\n> directly. Comment access please, I don''t need to edit, I''ll leave my notes on it before the call.\n>\n> Thanks,\n> Leonard', NULL, '[{"name": "Message-ID", "value": "<CAuC1dALZU8ymJT3qa3a7Oqa5TvKZhNe0pW0P7QP@mail.gmail.com>"}, {"name": "Date", "value": "Tue, 30 Sep 2025 20:41:27 +0000"}, {"name": "Subject", "value": "Re: beta go/no-go thursday"}, {"name": "From", "value": "Arthur Blake <arthur.blake@harmonygames.co>"}, {"name": "To", "value": "Douglas <douglas@harmonygames.co>"}, {"name": "Cc", "value": "Leonard Hayes <leonard.hayes@harmonygames.co>"}